sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant MutWH as Mutating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant RJCtrl as RayJob Controller
    participant RCCtrl as RayCluster Controller
    participant SubmitPod as Submitter Job Pod
    participant RayHead as Ray Head Pod<br/>Dashboard 8265/TCP
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant RSCtrl as RayService Controller
    participant ServeSvc as Serve Service<br/>8000/TCP HTTP

    Note over User,RayHead: Flow 1: RayJob Submission (K8sJobMode)
    User->>K8sAPI: POST RayJob CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>MutWH: Admission webhook<br/>HTTPS/9443
    MutWH-->>K8sAPI: Mutated (OpenShift defaults)
    K8sAPI-->>User: RayJob created
    RJCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create RayCluster CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    RCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create head/worker pods, services<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>RCCtrl: Resources created
    RJCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Submitter Job<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    SubmitPod->>RayHead: POST /api/jobs<br/>HTTP/8265 (in-cluster)
    RayHead-->>SubmitPod: Job submitted
    RJCtrl->>RayHead: GET /api/jobs/{id}<br/>HTTP/8265 (in-cluster)
    RayHead-->>RJCtrl: Job status

    Note over User,KRBP: Flow 2: Ray Dashboard Access via Gateway API (OpenShift)
    User->>Gateway: GET /ray/{ns}/{cluster}/<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS<br/>Auth: OIDC Token
    Gateway->>KRBP: Forward request<br/>HTTPS/8443 TLS<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    KRBP->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS
    K8sAPI-->>KRBP: Token valid
    KRBP->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS
    K8sAPI-->>KRBP: Access granted
    KRBP->>RayHead: GET / (rewritten)<br/>HTTP/8265 (loopback)
    RayHead-->>KRBP: Dashboard HTML
    KRBP-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>User: Dashboard page

    Note over RSCtrl,ServeSvc: Flow 3: RayService Incremental Upgrade
    RSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create pending RayCluster<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>RSCtrl: Pending cluster created
    RSCtrl->>RayHead: PUT /api/serve/applications<br/>HTTP/8265
    RayHead-->>RSCtrl: Serve config applied
    RSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update HTTPRoute backends<br/>(weighted traffic split)
    Gateway->>ServeSvc: Traffic to active cluster<br/>HTTP/8000
    Gateway->>ServeSvc: Traffic to pending cluster<br/>HTTP/8000 (increasing weight)
    RSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Delete old RayCluster<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
